// shared transform — Unicode casefold plus bidirectional ё→е — at both
// index-write and query time, so «ёлка» matches "Елка" and vice versa.
// Serving is bounded 8+8: at most eight series and eight item ids per
// query, ranked server-side.
//
// The package is a pure leaf: it imports nothing from mellifera — all
// store and naming access arrives as cmd-built Deps closures — so api can
// depend on it without inverting the dependency graph.
